==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[peg]], driven into the [[ground]], to hold a [[rope]] that supports a [[tent]].
#: {{syn|en|spike|stake}}
#: {{ux|en|Upon arrival at the campsite, they discovered that they had forgotten the '''tent pegs'''; they had to use rocks and logs to tether the tent instead.}}
# {{lb|en|Cockney rhyming slang}} An [[egg]].

